d term (in years)</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.86%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:16.89%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_6_30_2023_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_qviP5eOT9kixMb1dwVlvBA" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedTerm1" id="Tc_8I0mSuEdZEiedD_S8EUwkw_4_2">6.0</ix:nonNumeric></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.86%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:15.35%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_6_30_2022_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_XLKQu8cYzkmuUy9SR4Tp4A" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedTerm1" id="Narr_6spM3op38kSkjm5cPcjHoA">3.5</ix:nonNumeric> - <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_6_30_2022_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_1LdM7xUHx06HcSyiI75W7w" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedTerm1" id="Narr_teGsyXZ8VkSxgdRpdV0kLg">6.0</ix:nonNumeric></p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:64.01%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">Expected volatility</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.86%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:16.89%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_bceUYNWENkynMtI-dhaVoQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_6_30_2023_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_oajubidff0G2h6FPK_XYjw" decimals="5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedVolatilityRate" scale="-4" id="Narr_Ypc3t4QKiUm-UctxwrWT3g">100.6</ix:nonFraction>% - <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_bceUYNWENkynMtI-dhaVoQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_6_30_2023_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_FjCTL8mV_Ue_X9mWHlFX4g" decimals="5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedVolatilityRate" scale="-4" id="Narr_rmOe2GHKNkuUOVlJLgbnJg">100.8</ix:nonFraction>%</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.86%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:15.35%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_bceUYNWENkynMtI-dhaVoQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_6_30_2022_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_-LX5HHlKo0Gi6xeTE7Gr-Q" decimals="3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedVolatilityRate" scale="-2" id="Tc_BlHyQMbPck-_WRudkNJABw_5_4">93.2</ix:nonFraction>%</p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:64.01%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">Expected dividend yield</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.86%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:16.89%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;">&#8212;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.86%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:15.35%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;">&#8212;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:64.01%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">Fair value per share of underlying stock</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.86%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:16.89%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_Y1bGetDX602-1YG9VpYfmA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2023_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_5fErwQcsikiulV84WBl1XA" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:SharePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_b8AiVATQlEG5cYpRzvAmYA">5.67</ix:nonFraction> - $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_Y1bGetDX602-1YG9VpYfmA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2023_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_k-_XXxLTe0mRkTYyej7Ouw" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:SharePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_jE3XRpUkg0iNchixlNwXdA">5.97</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.86%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:15.35%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_Y1bGetDX602-1YG9VpYfmA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2022_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_h42KGEeDQUKZtiJuhmb9EQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:SharePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_03jbx6GxKUiBx3ayx3v9qw">24.80</ix:nonFraction> - $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_Y1bGetDX602-1YG9VpYfmA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2022_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_90eg10vxPUix0ldte2ezQw" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:SharePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_87ifc3cpUkym6tU9l2y4nw">49.00</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The weighted average grant date fair value per share of the options granted in the six months ended June 30, 2023 and 2022, was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_Y1bGetDX602-1YG9VpYfmA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_6_30_2023_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_qviP5eOT9kixMb1dwVlvBA" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_0P6iioqaFUClcHKDP5tWLA">4.59</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_Y1bGetDX602-1YG9VpYfmA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_6_30_2022_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_-LX5HHlKo0Gi6xeTE7Gr-Q" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_BRgFb_PL7EeusS9b6w160w">34.00</ix:nonFraction>, respectively.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt;">The Company recorded share-based compensation expense of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_86BiNKxhokSEgVs2ZDOtWA" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2023_To_6_30_2023_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_pQ3Jmex1-0Oz3TEf7DG3Tg" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="0" id="Narr_M-npQp-q90KLxSKQ_8J1AQ">175,484</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_86BiNKxhokSEgVs2ZDOtWA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_6_30_2023_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_qviP5eOT9kixMb1dwVlvBA" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="0" id="Narr_vLyKIbnkXEWIhlWq2Xuk-Q">334,244</ix:nonFraction> during the three and six months ended June 30, 2023, respectively, and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_86BiNKxhokSEgVs2ZDOtWA" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2022_To_6_30_2022_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_4T9dO6mX2UKduEe8GCo4nA" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="0" id="Narr_Ij-OUGZiTkunhNhwoV899w">98,599</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_86BiNKxhokSEgVs2ZDOtWA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_6_30_2022_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_-LX5HHlKo0Gi6xeTE7Gr-Q" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="0" id="Narr_NGzgcMgfoUef_aLashG6ow">159,172</ix:nonFraction> during the three and six months ended June 30, 2022, respectively, all of which related to stock options. The remaining share-based compensation expense to be recognized in the future is approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_86BiNKxhokSEgVs2ZDOtWA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_6_30_2022_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockMember_eP292PkK1Ei04jTPBJMHPQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="0" id="Narr_3tu5SRup40iPUSQpDw6AlQ">1,449,755</ix:nonFraction> over approximately <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_6_30_2023_oOUvyECQ20as3E35GlQ6sA" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedPeriodForRecognition1" id="Narr_zllvRj4ELk-IbGc9z-Un-A">2.2</ix:nonNumeric> years.</p></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_6_30_2023_oOUvyECQ20as3E35GlQ6sA" name="rnaz:EmployeeStockPurchasePlanTextBlock" id="Tb_joyiU-qxPECCs3U-K__5-A" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:8pt;padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;">(12)</b><b style="font-weight:bold;">&#160;</b><b style="font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;">Employee Stock Purchase Plan</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In 2021, the Company adopted an Employee Stock Purchase Plan (the &#8220;ESPP&#8221;) to provide eligible employees of the Company with opportunities to purchase shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock. The ESPP initially provided for the purchase of an aggregate of up to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Hs3AMsfv0k6O26KOAtV1Fg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2021_To_12_31_2021_mj6KeWz3SkmglTlO4Bbzfg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesEmployeeStockPurchasePlans" scale="0" id="Narr_cO1Gx6PV1UuhIeSAZbk2HA">7,500</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock. The number of shares of common stock available through the ESPP increased by <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Hs3AMsfv0k6O26KOAtV1Fg" contextRef="As_Of_1_31_2023_KhcgCEa7IUi401puOdsAFw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:SharesHeldInEmployeeStockOptionPlanAllocated" scale="0" id="Narr_H1TcDJGMjkKBf8TDgxEsNA">4,500</ix:nonFraction> shares in January 2022 and January 2023, and may be increased each subsequent year by up to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Hs3AMsfv0k6O26KOAtV1Fg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2021_-JuDzoQef0i4nUhWQ8em9A" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:SharesHeldInEmployeeStockOptionPlanAllocated" scale="0" id="Narr_ql2czPdQoECyS1TgU8CMqw">4,500</ix:nonFraction> shares.</p></ix:nonNumeric><a id="_cb8b0dd9_21bd_4a8e_ba1f_5ba1a2795821"></a><a id="_bdcce504_8bd3_4c7b_848f_f85d1d6c85fd"></a><a id="Tc_BxTNSlZCaUuW0m9i7AwNPg_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_ai9jP4rXOUOrQvxQ-zYMpQ_1_8"></a><a id="Tc_NWRvflGPEkyQjHGkonBXrg_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_96NKIwPbDkC3j4_1Wl6ReQ_2_8"></a><a id="Tc_tbwDk7--fEuy0lIiF7j_dg_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_NVHzfPBR1E2JP5vYl7RnJg_3_5"></a><a id="Tc_bXleqEK4uUC5tHSJoQ4jTQ_3_8"></a><a id="Tc_Zqbwm9wKOEiLLlBDYTOdCQ_3_11"></a><a id="Tc_2M473_8ZJUe1c0P-tcSMEA_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_UDae-HsbQEukb8OAIXr-zA_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_mVnPLPtrD0OQki837L6DUA_5_2"></a><a id="Tc_u1Tx7oLL7Eynk9uu09z4Xg_5_5"></a><a id="Tc_ChcILICRp0uMA0dbyWcStQ_5_8"></a><a id="Tc__yGuZsEgoESly5lWr-ZW2A_5_11"></a><a id="Tc_sQY2iEI2ykWFNqTeGWpqFw_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_XS9-sqWzs0qAjg-EMFeaxQ_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_goxhMnvwsk-fZCl97wsCpg_7_2"></a><a id="Tc_WhoaHXwNr0SQvYcs1cmWIA_7_5"></a><a id="Tc_F3EmgrKTo0G3LQGjKp6DUw_7_8"></a><a id="Tc_FGkqbcTnnEuzPH7YPapYug_7_11"></a><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_6_30_2023_oOUvyECQ20as3E35GlQ6sA" name="us-gaap:EarningsPerShareTextBlock" id="Tb_t7zW3HtgvkC-R-xnM-VLHg" continuedAt="Tb_t7zW3HtgvkC-R-xnM-VLHg_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:8pt;font-weight:bold;padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;">(13)</b>&#160;<b style="font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;">Net Loss Per Share</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company reported net losses for the three and six months ended June 30, 2023 and 2022. Reported basic and diluted net loss per share attributable to common stockholders are the same for all periods because shares issuable in connection with Contingent Securities have been excluded from the computation of diluted weighted-average shares outstanding. As indicated in the table below, the effect of their inclusion would have been antidilutive.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In accordance with ASC 260-10-45-13, a penny warrant is an instrument that requires the holder to pay little or no consideration to receive the shares upon exercise of the warrant. Since the shares underlying the PFWs are issuable for little or no consideration, the Company considered them outstanding in the context of basic earnings per share.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt;">The following table sets forth the computation of basic and diluted loss per share:</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_6_30_2023_oOUvyECQ20as3E35GlQ6sA" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfEarningsPerShareBasicAndDilutedTableTextBlock" id="Tb_9DCU9KCNP0SmQ4sUb0ZrOg" continuedAt="Tb_9DCU9KCNP0SmQ4sUb0ZrOg_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:9pt;margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:80%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:42.4%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.85%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Tim